Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.20,0:08:27.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,《剑风传奇黄金时代篇：霸王之卵》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.03,0:01:54.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,射
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.68,0:02:06.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快点快点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.47,0:02:27.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好 撞啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.90,0:02:34.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快乘上来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.03,0:03:14.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好勒 一口气压上去
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.73,0:03:18.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,取大将首级者重重有赏
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.37,0:03:35.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嘿嘿 先走一步了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.67,0:03:36.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,给我站住
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.83,0:03:47.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是巴兹索
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.87,0:03:50.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,巴兹索就是那个斩杀30人的...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.02,0:03:51.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,传说曾徒手杀熊的...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.95,0:03:53.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么了啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.22,0:03:57.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有谁想被打爆脑袋的给我上前来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.35,0:03:59.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们到底在犹豫什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.75,0:04:02.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还不速速斩了巴兹索 扬名天下
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.35,0:04:03.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,上啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.94,0:04:05.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不 还是你上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.61,0:04:07.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对手太棘手啦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.54,0:04:12.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可恶 这些佣兵真是...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.61,0:04:16.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哼 他们这些软骨头连卵蛋都缩起来了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.29,0:04:19.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,小的们 不用手软
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.69,0:04:21.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,挖出他们的眼珠
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.17,0:04:22.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,扯出他们的肠子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.21,0:04:25.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,然后直接喂猪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.56,0:04:41.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这谁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.35,0:04:43.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这不还是个小鬼吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.12,0:04:44.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哪里来的佣兵啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.24,0:04:45.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快看他那把剑
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.71,0:04:46.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还真是好面子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.98,0:04:49.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,脑瓜被削掉的话可就不好玩了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.04,0:04:51.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对手可是巴兹索啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.85,0:04:53.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,10枚
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.13,0:04:54.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.72,0:05:00.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是那个铁疙瘩的价钱啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.68,0:05:02.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们佣兵跟骑士不同
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.88,0:05:04.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,靠名誉可不能当饭吃
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.73,0:05:06.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,竟敢对巴兹索大人...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.33,0:05:08.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,呵呵 真是可靠之极啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.74,0:05:09.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如此甚好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.00,0:05:13.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,成功斩获这厮首级之时即是你7枚银币落袋之日
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.20,0:05:16.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,切 小气的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.38,0:05:19.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没办法了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.77,0:05:36.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,小子 你会后悔的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.50,0:05:39.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为了区区7枚银币被打爆脑...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.66,0:05:46.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好快
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.49,0:05:51.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂 巴兹索被压制着呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.72,0:05:52.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是怎么回事咧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.43,0:05:54.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,从没见过这样的巴兹索
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.19,0:05:55.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,到底是什么人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.78,0:06:00.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可恶 你他妈的太嚣张了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.19,0:06:39.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等 等等啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.42,0:06:41.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,您这身手 让我心服口服
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.07,0:06:43.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我巴兹索...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.97,0:06:46.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,巴 巴兹索他...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.54,0:07:17.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就趁现在 敌人露怯啦 突击
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.87,0:07:26.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嘿 来了个狠角色啊 哪个队里的啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.54,0:07:29.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在是佩服的时候吗 都被人扳下一城了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.53,0:07:31.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有怨言你找白痴将军说去
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.47,0:07:32.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,又不赖我们
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.40,0:07:34.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我说 格里菲斯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.41,0:07:36.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,和你比起来谁更强啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.13,0:07:38.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别问无聊的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.62,0:07:39.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,明摆着是格里菲斯强吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.38,0:10:02.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好了 下一个
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.06,0:10:09.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,两个月的工资和这次的赏金
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.05,0:10:14.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我说 你不重新考虑一下吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.60,0:10:17.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,工资是现在的三倍
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.83,0:10:20.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那些人甚至可以给你武士的名分哦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.84,0:10:27.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对我们佣兵来说这简直像是美梦一样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.46,0:10:34.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,美梦? 那是什么? 能吃吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.61,0:10:40.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等...等等
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.48,0:10:44.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们还说能保证你的地位和金钱哦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.58,0:10:46.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还有什么不满足的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.39,0:10:49.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,受管束什么的我才不要啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.10,0:10:57.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,下一个
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.52,0:11:16.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是盗贼吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.90,0:11:29.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好勒 上啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.96,0:11:45.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,畜生
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.45,0:11:47.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,给我等着瞧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.50,0:12:14.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这...这家伙 真是强啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.03,0:12:17.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂 被人干掉了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.64,0:12:18.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么办啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.22,0:12:22.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哥尔卡斯那家伙完全害怕了啊 哎呀
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.83,0:12:24.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是 那家伙真的很强啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.28,0:12:28.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,啊...能杀掉巴兹索可不是盖的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.54,0:12:29.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么办啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.06,0:12:31.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哼 别怪我没提醒过你们
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.12,0:12:34.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,卡斯嘉 你上
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.71,0:12:37.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为什么啊 是哥尔卡斯自己擅自...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.93,0:12:41.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,知道了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.91,0:12:45.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂 你上啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.77,0:12:48.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为什么啊 是你的主意吧 你这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.63,0:12:50.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.28,0:12:52.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我靠 笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.52,0:12:53.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,完了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.20,0:13:00.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,退下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.36,0:13:02.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.95,0:13:12.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这可真够长的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.02,0:13:35.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,女人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.70,0:13:36.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.00,0:13:46.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那个卡斯嘉都被逼住了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.99,0:13:48.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂喂 这太假了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.61,0:13:58.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要被干掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.78,0:14:07.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,格里菲斯
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.72,0:14:10.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,当心啊 这家伙很难对付哦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.76,0:14:13.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,格里菲斯
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.29,0:14:15.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这么一来 你也算是完蛋了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.63,0:14:17.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,干掉他啊 格里菲斯
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.86,0:14:25.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,能把剑放下吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.57,0:14:30.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不行吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.57,0:14:45.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好...快
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.38,0:14:52.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.17,0:14:59.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,强啊 仅仅一击而已
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.93,0:15:08.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,格里...菲斯
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.89,0:17:14.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,甘比诺 可找到你了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.69,0:17:54.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什...痛...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.48,0:18:13.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,唔...喂
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.39,0:18:15.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,到底什么情况
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.54,0:18:21.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是哪
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.99,0:18:23.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为什么你会在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.40,0:18:34.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你他妈的要是就那样被格里菲斯杀掉 那该多好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.93,0:18:39.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你...你这...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.81,0:18:42.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这拳是为了死去的马儿
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.62,0:18:50.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,狗屎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.88,0:18:52.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那个娘们
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.78,0:19:04.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好 下这里 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.91,0:19:12.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你要感谢卡斯嘉啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.64,0:19:16.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你的身体因流血过多而开始冷下来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.82,0:19:19.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,她两天两夜睡在你身边为你保暖
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.42,0:19:20.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什...什么
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.61,0:19:24.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是格里菲斯的命令啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.01,0:19:28.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,说什么让男人温暖是女人的使命...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.07,0:19:32.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,捷度 你这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.72,0:19:34.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对不住 对不住
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.28,0:19:36.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,似乎完全清醒过来了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.80,0:19:40.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,格里菲斯 早上好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.05,0:19:58.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我是格里菲斯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.45,0:19:59.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你呢 叫什么名字
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.77,0:20:03.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,格斯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.39,0:20:09.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很厉害的剑啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.51,0:20:15.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我可挥不动哦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.61,0:20:20.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,能来一下吗 跟我一起
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.09,0:20:28.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哟 格里菲斯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.03,0:20:32.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,格里菲斯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.09,0:20:42.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你还真受欢迎啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.55,0:20:49.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,啊 忍不住了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.56,0:20:52.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.98,0:20:55.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这么快就能动了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.56,0:20:58.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,格里菲斯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.51,0:21:02.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这氛围很奇怪啊 这里到底是?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.30,0:21:03.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,鹰之团
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.02,0:21:06.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,听说过吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.67,0:21:12.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,啊 是最不想在战场上与之为敌的佣兵团之一
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.64,0:21:15.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在之前的战斗中也是相当棘手呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.88,0:21:18.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是嘛 就是这些家伙啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.39,0:21:23.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没错 我们就是鹰之团
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.55,0:21:35.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这里视野不错啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.44,0:21:36.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.76,0:21:41.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为什么避开了我的要害
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.15,0:21:46.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,以你的实力 应该能击中的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.01,0:21:55.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因为我想要你啊 格斯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.65,0:22:01.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,死基佬 原来你也有那种癖好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.19,0:22:06.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我看了你和巴兹索的单挑
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.36,0:22:08.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很精彩呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.40,0:22:11.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是 也真是惊险呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.73,0:22:16.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果没在他的战斧上留下裂痕的话
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.07,0:22:21.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,被打爆头的 应该是你才对
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.78,0:22:26.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也许吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.00,0:22:28.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你这人挺实诚啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.44,0:22:32.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你战斗的方式看上去就像是
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.65,0:22:34.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在拿自己的生命进行试探一般
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.93,0:22:37.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就我的感觉而言
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.93,0:22:40.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你是故意将自己置身于死亡危机之下
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.63,0:22:43.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,然后再拼命从这危机之中捡回性命
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.68,0:22:45.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这就是我的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.93,0:22:51.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我很中意你
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.95,0:22:54.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很想要你 格斯
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.68,0:23:03.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要是我说不行呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.95,0:23:05.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不行吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.87,0:23:08.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,啊 我拒绝
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.34,0:23:09.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,说得好像自己什么都知道似的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.75,0:23:15.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在别人身上开了个大洞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.86,0:23:18.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还想来套交情吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.05,0:23:21.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,用这家伙来个了断吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.83,0:23:25.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我赢的话也要在你胸口开个跟我这个一样的大洞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.07,0:23:28.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要是我赢了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.78,0:23:32.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要我入队也好 要插我后庭也罢悉听尊便
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.14,0:23:39.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.28,0:23:46.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我也并不讨厌...用武力解决
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.61,0:23:48.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,格里菲斯
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.16,0:23:50.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你别出手 卡斯嘉
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.34,0:23:52.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.99,0:23:55.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想要的东西就一定要得到手
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.46,0:24:00.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你这瞧不起人的态度让俺很不爽哎
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.02,0:24:16.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.70,0:24:17.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂 快看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.72,0:24:19.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那个混蛋 好了伤疤忘了痛
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.71,0:24:21.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,都给我别出手
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.39,0:24:22.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是格里菲斯的命令
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.06,0:24:24.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,改日再战也行哦
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.08,0:24:26.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在大病初愈可对你不利哦
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.41,0:24:28.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别嚣张
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.15,0:24:30.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,格里菲斯
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.82,0:24:31.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,卑鄙啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.19,0:24:45.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为了胜利不择手段
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.22,0:24:47.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我越来越中意你了哟
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.40,0:24:50.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是 这样下去你也挥不了剑了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.71,0:24:52.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.87,0:24:54.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就此收手也可以哦
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.59,0:24:56.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就你小子话多
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.80,0:24:57.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不如让老子教教你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.50,0:25:01.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在战场上 嘴巴要这样用
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.99,0:25:06.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,格里菲斯
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.54,0:25:19.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,自己的血味道如何啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.42,0:25:24.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这么白净的脸还从没被人揍过吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.08,0:25:31.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在你的小弟们面前可实在是对不住呢
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.37,0:25:34.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这就给你个了断
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.28,0:25:42.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.15,0:25:43.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,成功了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.72,0:25:46.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,刚才那招 确实奏效了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.43,0:25:48.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是 也就到此为止了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.06,0:25:53.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要认输还是要就这么被我卸掉肩关节
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.80,0:25:55.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,选吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.62,0:26:01.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,混蛋狗屎
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.10,0:26:07.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看你那鳖三的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.79,0:26:20.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这么一来你就是我的人了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.08,0:26:30.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,从来没有说过
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.78,0:26:34.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,格里菲斯从来没有对任何人说过那种话
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.64,0:26:48.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这么一来 我也算是鹰之团的一员了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.61,0:26:53.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,格斯 你要为我工作
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.63,0:26:56.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为了我所追求的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.54,0:27:03.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我要得到属于我的国家
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.63,0:27:10.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,格斯 你要死在哪里由我来决定
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.97,0:27:41.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,队列别乱
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.57,0:27:45.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,让裘达狗们知道我们身为米特兰德的骄傲
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.32,0:27:58.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别叫放走了一个
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.45,0:28:00.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只要是能动的全给我杀了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.96,0:28:22.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,敌黑羊铁枪重装骑兵团威猛可怖
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.80,0:28:24.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我军死伤甚重
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.09,0:28:27.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如此下去此处本镇亦恐有失
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.80,0:28:36.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没人...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.96,0:28:40.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,能打倒裘达的黑色恶魔吗...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.97,0:28:42.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,冲啊
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.11,0:28:47.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,米特兰德国王的首级由我黑羊铁枪重装骑兵团来斩获
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.54,0:28:54.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嗯? 愚不可及
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.37,0:28:57.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在吾等面前竟敢单骑突进
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.70,0:29:04.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也好 给我踩扁他
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.02,0:29:19.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎可能 基恩将军他
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.93,0:29:21.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只一刀就被...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.32,0:29:30.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,敌方就一个人包围他
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.05,0:29:31.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.47,0:29:33.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.09,0:29:36.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,竟然从后面来
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.13,0:29:38.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那 那个是
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.54,0:29:40.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,鹰之团
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.59,0:29:58.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,战场的死神众
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.49,0:30:03.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为什么这帮家伙会在米特兰德军里
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.41,0:30:10.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,裘达撤退了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.20,0:30:14.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,太混蛋了区区一支佣兵团竟扭转了整个战局
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.72,0:30:18.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,鹰之团...竟至于斯
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.87,0:30:21.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是的 与之签约实属明智
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.74,0:30:24.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只是碰巧奇袭成功罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.08,0:30:26.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,太高估他们了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.80,0:30:30.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是我们没能打败的黑羊团被他们打败了这是事实
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.95,0:30:33.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,之后的突击也很老练
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.51,0:30:35.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还有那料敌先机的战略
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.55,0:30:37.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,每一点都...嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.18,0:30:41.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们的团长叫什么来着
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.27,0:30:44.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,叫格里菲斯 陛下
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.74,0:30:46.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,格里菲斯
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.87,0:31:09.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,格斯
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.80,0:31:16.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真厉害啊 格斯
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.46,0:31:19.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你也太出风头了啦还搞单骑突进什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.49,0:31:23.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,抱歉啦 我一个人自顾自地往前冲了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.59,0:31:28.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,呵 你这哪是在反省啊
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.55,0:31:31.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就是就是 这样可没有一点队长的样子哦
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.22,0:31:40.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不管怎样我们还是胜利了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.87,0:31:41.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,去庆功吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.21,0:31:43.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就是就是
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.68,0:31:45.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大家一起干杯吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.69,0:31:47.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,女人 去喊女人过来
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.51,0:31:48.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,今天晚上不醉不归
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.82,0:31:51.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好勒 跟我来
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.43,0:31:53.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为什么是哥尔卡斯你带头啊
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.21,0:31:56.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,功劳最大的是格斯吧 照老规矩来 格斯
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.39,0:32:00.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有话跟你说 能赏个脸吗
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.96,0:32:02.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,格斯队长殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.72,0:32:11.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你到底是干什么啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.01,0:32:13.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.11,0:32:14.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别装傻
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.46,0:32:17.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你的任务应该是牵制敌人
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.73,0:32:22.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但却竟然甩下同伴从敌人正面单骑突进
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.01,0:32:25.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只是碰巧让你成功过你就觉得无所谓了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.10,0:32:30.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你的我行我素甚至有可能会让整个鹰之团陷入危险
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.72,0:32:33.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你也给我看清楚自己的立场啊
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.16,0:32:37.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,抱歉了 以后会注意的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.68,0:32:40.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哼 你总是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.05,0:32:42.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,光说不练
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.13,0:32:45.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你他妈的跟三年前还是一个样子
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.53,0:32:49.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只要能在战场上挥剑砍杀就满足了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.75,0:32:54.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,完全没有为同伴考虑过就只是一条疯狗而已
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.78,0:33:01.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不对 我已经不是从前的我了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.18,0:33:06.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,同伴的安危我其实也...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.41,0:33:08.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们俩都给我适可而止吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.76,0:33:10.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,格里菲斯
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.50,0:33:13.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我会好好说说格斯的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.43,0:33:24.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,格里菲斯你也太宠那家伙了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.69,0:33:32.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们的关系真不是一般的差啊
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.19,0:33:33.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,又不怨我
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.54,0:33:36.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一直是那家伙来找我麻烦
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.15,0:33:42.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,话虽如此 都三年了也该适可而止了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.79,0:33:44.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,三年...吗
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.02,0:33:48.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,啊 从我和你决斗时算起
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.82,0:33:51.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那场架打得痛快
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.21,0:33:54.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,打架就得像那样才爽
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.84,0:34:01.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,来 走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.03,0:34:04.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,今天酒宴的主角可是你哦
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.45,0:34:07.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,格里菲斯
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.08,0:34:14.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对不起了 今天的战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.34,0:34:19.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,格斯 你就为我而战吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.15,0:34:22.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因为你是我的人
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.57,0:34:40.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,听说了吗 格里菲斯殿下的事
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.91,0:34:43.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嗯 这事情可麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.34,0:34:49.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,鹰之团自加入我军参战以来虽确实是连战连胜
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.09,0:34:51.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但也不过是佣兵罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.27,0:34:53.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谁出钱就给谁卖命而已
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.29,0:34:58.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嗯 佣兵什么的在没有战事的时候跟盗贼没两样
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.69,0:35:01.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,竟然胡闹地将这种货色捧起来
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.94,0:35:04.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,说的就是贱民就是贱民
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.70,0:35:07.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,若是处理不善的话会相当麻烦哦
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.78,0:35:09.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但若不雇佣他们
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.24,0:35:12.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们可能会被裘达歼灭
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.37,0:35:15.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嗯 就这一点看
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.19,0:35:18.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,国王陛下要接纳他们也不是不能理解
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.83,0:35:21.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是 即便如此...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.28,0:35:25.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就是 即便如此把平民升为贵族也太...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.89,0:35:27.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,陛下也太异想天开了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.13,0:35:34.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,听说在之前的战斗中鹰之团被委以先锋重任
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.34,0:35:38.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么 那尤里乌斯殿下的白龙骑士团呢
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.67,0:35:40.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,据说被解除委任了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.45,0:35:45.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,殿下成为裘达阶下囚时 巨大赎金的事情也是...啊
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.34,0:36:04.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,福代斯卿殒命敌手
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.68,0:36:07.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,格斯的部队还在压制残党
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.02,0:36:10.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哼 很少见他这么狼狈呢
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.78,0:36:13.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不认为这个城会有那么难打
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.21,0:36:20.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为什么不早点告诉我
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.61,0:36:21.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是因为...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.96,0:36:24.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有人说这里面有财宝什么的 所以...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.15,0:36:29.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,从里面不断传来惨叫声
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.04,0:36:30.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,连进去查探情况的家伙们也...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.47,0:36:32.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,够了 让我上
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.95,0:36:34.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,放开我 加斯顿
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.45,0:36:36.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那么 去请求格里菲斯大将的支援...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.80,0:36:40.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你敢这么做你试试看 杀了你哦
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.33,0:36:42.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,队长
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.26,0:36:43.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谁都别跟来
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.52,0:37:29.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么回事啊 这些尸体
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.33,0:37:58.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么啊 这是...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.84,0:38:02.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不死的 佐德?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.67,0:38:07.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,啊 这次的战斗 他似乎加入了敌方阵营
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.45,0:38:10.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,佐德 就是那个传说中的佣兵?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.84,0:38:14.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嗯 那家伙斩下首级的数量都可以组成一个国家了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.10,0:38:18.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,佐德之所以令人恐惧并不仅仅因为他的强大
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.99,0:38:23.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那家伙的武勇事迹从200年前就开始口耳相传了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.00,0:38:27.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,竟然有200年了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.88,0:38:31.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这就是为什么佐德会被称作不死者的原因了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.39,0:38:34.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好强 太强了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.56,0:38:39.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,干得很好啊 小子
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.69,0:38:42.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,竟然能够接住我的剑到这个地步
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.22,0:38:43.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.85,0:38:50.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只有这把剑还算能跟它拼一拼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.00,0:39:21.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是嘛 目标原来是我的剑啊
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.83,0:39:28.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,用剑在我身上砍得那么深的人类你是第一个
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.66,0:39:35.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我很高兴哦
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.79,0:39:38.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也许就是为了遇到像你这样的对手
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.31,0:39:44.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我才跨越300年活到现在
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.11,0:39:55.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.82,0:40:02.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这种怪物怎么可能真的存在...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.20,0:40:08.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,战起来
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.24,0:40:11.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别让老子失望
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.74,0:40:24.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你的力量也就这一点而已吗
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.52,0:40:30.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不 作为人类来说应该讲你已经干得不错了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.74,0:40:36.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那就是佐德?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.42,0:40:40.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别松懈 第二发
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.98,0:40:42.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,放
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.82,0:40:58.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,胆敢玷污这场战斗的无论是谁都不可饶恕
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.97,0:41:05.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不行的 快逃
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.86,0:41:12.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,卡斯嘉 让所有人撤退
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.87,0:41:18.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,格里菲斯 要去救那家伙?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.06,0:41:21.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,格斯
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.21,0:41:24.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,笨蛋 干嘛要来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.81,0:41:27.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有意见也等从那怪物手里逃掉再说
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.88,0:41:29.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,来战吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.02,0:41:33.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在肉体彻底粉碎前跟老子我打个痛快
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.56,0:41:35.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.19,0:41:37.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,格里菲斯
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.03,0:41:40.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,能动吗
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.64,0:41:42.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不动的话会被干掉
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.37,0:41:44.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你往左
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.88,0:41:45.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,上
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.24,0:42:01.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,格斯 一口气甩掉他
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.86,0:42:06.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,格里菲斯
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.48,0:42:14.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,竟然同时遇到两个能够伤到我的人类
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.27,0:42:19.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,然后同时失去你们两人这真是...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.62,0:42:24.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,住手
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.94,0:42:26.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那家伙可是我的...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.41,0:42:29.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我的...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.84,0:42:35.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,永别啦 人类
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.95,0:42:42.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是...霸王之卵
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.34,0:42:47.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为何此处会出现真红的贝黑莱特
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.07,0:42:57.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是吗 是这种设定吗
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.54,0:43:08.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,小子 给你个忠告...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.69,0:43:10.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不 我敢预言
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.74,0:43:17.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果你对这个男人来说是真正挚友的话
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.63,0:43:20.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,最好做好心理准备
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.05,0:43:23.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,此人的野望幻灭之际
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.59,0:43:26.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,即是你死亡降临之期
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.13,0:43:30.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而且是绝对无法逃脱的死亡
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.34,0:43:45.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.12,0:43:46.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,恶魔?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.88,0:43:49.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.40,0:43:56.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还有
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.86,0:43:59.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么真正挚友? 还说我会死?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.03,0:44:03.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,搞不懂 到底是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.58,0:44:05.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,格里菲斯 振作啊
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.73,0:44:10.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,格里菲斯 没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.76,0:44:11.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别过来
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.94,0:44:16.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,都怪你 让格里菲斯遭这种罪
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.32,0:44:20.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,全都怪你
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.11,0:44:44.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你他妈的跟三年前还是一个德性
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.77,0:44:48.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只是只疯狗而已
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.52,0:44:54.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,都怪你 让格里菲斯遭这种罪
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.13,0:44:56.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,全都怪你
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.40,0:45:04.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,胡说什么呢 那个婆娘
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.98,0:45:05.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,生龙活虎啊你
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.69,0:45:11.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,明明比我伤得还重
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.37,0:45:14.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你真是生命力堪比小强啊
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.76,0:45:19.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,诺斯费拉图 佐德吗
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.64,0:45:21.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,笑不出来呢
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.07,0:45:24.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那种怪物竟然存在于现实中什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.31,0:45:26.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是反过来想的话
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.47,0:45:32.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,或许这也证明世界上存在着人智所不及的某种庞大的事物呢
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.71,0:45:37.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,比如说 神
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.81,0:45:38.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我看是恶魔吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.40,0:45:42.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,都一样吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.07,0:45:46.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,说起来你一直挂脖子里的那个
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.02,0:45:55.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那个怪物看到这个就飞走了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.10,0:45:57.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,到底是什么东西啊
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.48,0:45:59.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是贝黑莱特
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.83,0:46:02.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,以前从占卜婆婆那里得到的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.16,0:46:07.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,持有它的人
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.90,0:46:13.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,会经历以自己的血肉为代价从而得到世界的命运
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.42,0:46:18.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哼 得到世界吗
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.71,0:46:42.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真是恶心啊
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.73,0:46:43.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别吓我行吗
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.86,0:46:49.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很不错吧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.03,0:46:56.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真是的 你的这种性格还是没变呢
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.10,0:47:02.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我可是不会变的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.49,0:47:11.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.30,0:47:12.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嗯?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.40,0:47:15.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我在怎么升也不过是你一个部下
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.48,0:47:16.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,干嘛来救我
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.40,0:47:24.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没什么理由哦
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.74,0:47:30.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我为了你挺身而出需要有理由吗
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.78,0:47:43.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不 我只是...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.66,0:47:46.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,伤势不要紧了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.83,0:47:47.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,陛下
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.10,0:48:01.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂 格斯
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.70,0:48:05.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你这家伙在国王陛下御前 也太无礼了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.66,0:48:19.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嘛 行了 平身
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.28,0:48:22.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,格里菲斯卿
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.53,0:48:26.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你率领的鹰之团一直都干得不错
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.39,0:48:28.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这真是诚惶诚恐
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.57,0:48:32.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,陛下对新晋的区区一个团长不必这么...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.59,0:48:34.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不必如此拘泥啊
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.12,0:48:42.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,重臣之中确实有人对于平民出身的你们感到不快
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.17,0:48:46.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是靠威信和地位这些是赢不了战争的
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.21,0:48:51.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,朕反倒对你们这些不拘一格之人寄予着莫大的期望
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.38,0:48:57.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,陛下此言臣感激不尽心悦诚服
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.74,0:49:02.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那边的女士是?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.62,0:49:08.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,啊 是我女儿夏洛特
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.94,0:49:13.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,她不喜欢严肃的武人所以很少出来
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.96,0:49:15.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,夏洛特
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.20,0:49:22.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因为是独生女所以有点太宠溺了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.31,0:49:25.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,原谅她吧 格里菲斯卿
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.51,0:49:29.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,来 走吧 夏洛特
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.86,0:49:57.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,您不要紧吧
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.80,0:50:02.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,失礼了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.52,0:50:04.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,请多加小心
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.56,0:50:07.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那...那个
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.24,0:50:14.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,混蛋 敢触碰公主殿下的身体也太无礼了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.98,0:50:18.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂 大叔
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.22,0:50:25.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我失礼了 尤里乌斯将军阁下
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.21,0:50:29.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,知道就好
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.92,0:50:32.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,走吧公主殿下 您父亲还等着您呢
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.46,0:50:36.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好...好的 叔叔
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.81,0:50:58.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他妈的 为什么我们要陪这些贵族在这耍猴戏啊
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.61,0:51:00.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.46,0:51:05.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嘛 这也是工作需要啊
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.06,0:51:08.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,总比上战场要好多了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.60,0:51:13.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不会被弓矢射中也不会被打破头呢
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.27,0:51:18.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,老子还情愿上战场呢
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.96,0:51:21.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我去 真能说 这个只知道砍人的笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.18,0:51:23.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哥尔卡斯你又来了...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.54,0:51:24.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,吵死了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.73,0:51:26.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这种狩猎的警备任务
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.34,0:51:28.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,之前都只有出身正宗的骑士团才能执行
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.94,0:51:30.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是很光荣的工作哦
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.04,0:51:36.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而且这也是我们大家在战场上 拼死拼活立下战功所得到的结果
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.76,0:51:39.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你这家伙却说这很白痴?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.52,0:51:40.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哥尔卡斯
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.17,0:51:42.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这么想挥剑的话
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.30,0:51:44.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你自己一个人去挥吧
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.57,0:51:45.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你这只知道砍人的傻瓜
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.36,0:51:56.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嘛 这也算是一种爱好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.80,0:51:58.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,呵呵 失陪...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.69,0:52:16.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,您不喜欢狩猎吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.37,0:52:28.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,男生们为什么总是喜欢流血的事情呢
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.33,0:52:30.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,战争也是 狩猎也是
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.28,0:52:47.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,公主殿下 在这里...像这样
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.15,0:53:08.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,阁下
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.16,0:53:10.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等等 要等机会
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.54,0:53:13.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂 去那边了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.08,0:53:13.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,逼死他
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.95,0:53:36.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,求你了 快停下
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.05,0:53:51.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,已经没事了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.72,0:54:02.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,您没受伤吧
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.72,0:54:12.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,您怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.61,0:54:16.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好...好可怕 非常的
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.30,0:54:19.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,心脏到现在还跳得厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.90,0:54:21.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我竟然这么...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.92,0:54:28.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,您的烦闷似乎稍稍排遣了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.14,0:54:31.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,来 我们回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.52,0:54:33.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大家正担心呢
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.75,0:54:35.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,格里菲斯
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.79,0:54:38.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,格里菲斯
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.31,0:54:41.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,格斯
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.26,0:54:51.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,格里菲斯
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.45,0:54:59.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.64,0:55:00.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,格里菲斯
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.47,0:55:02.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂 公主
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.76,0:55:04.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,到底怎么回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.51,0:55:06.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这根箭是从哪射过来的
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.96,0:55:08.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好 好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.20,0:55:10.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,格里菲斯 格里菲斯
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.79,0:55:14.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别哭哦 卡斯嘉
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.33,0:55:16.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,格里菲斯
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.22,0:55:21.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,箭呢 不要紧吗
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.76,0:55:24.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别碰哦
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.65,0:55:26.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可能涂有剧毒
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.71,0:55:28.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那就更令人担心了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.76,0:55:32.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不 这玩意帮我挡了一下
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.79,0:55:36.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,霸王之卵
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.50,0:55:38.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,太假了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.51,0:55:39.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,竟然会有这种事
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.00,0:55:42.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,超强的狗屎运
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.27,0:55:43.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不可想像啊
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.10,0:55:45.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这运气可不是一般好
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.36,0:55:47.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,奇迹啊
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.17,0:55:52.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我带部下在这附近的树丛里找找看
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.66,0:55:58.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,格里菲斯 先脱下甲胄吧
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.36,0:56:00.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看看有没有受伤
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.00,0:56:16.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,代价可不会小哦
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.83,0:56:18.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这个毒的代价...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.36,0:56:28.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真的假的
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.09,0:56:39.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这算什么啊 你这副样子
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.92,0:56:45.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就这样你还想继承我的白龙骑士团啊
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.24,0:56:46.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,算了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.39,0:56:52.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,父...父亲大人我还能...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.05,0:56:56.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,阿德尼斯大人 请快处理一下伤势
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.98,0:57:00.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,您父亲这是为您着想
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.87,0:57:03.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,才会更严苛地对您
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.01,0:57:06.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,请千万不要恨他
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.06,0:57:13.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,杀人? 杀谁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.21,0:57:17.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这个国家的第二王位继承人
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.35,0:57:20.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,白龙将军尤里乌斯伯爵
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.48,0:57:27.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,射中我的箭上涂有毒药
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.50,0:57:32.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是王家代代相传用于暗杀的剧毒
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.11,0:57:35.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是一桩肮脏的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.91,0:57:38.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,绝对不允许失败
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.43,0:57:43.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也不能被看见面容
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.03,0:57:51.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以我才想把这个工作托付于你
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.22,0:57:54.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,能接受吗
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.84,0:57:55.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真不像你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.87,0:58:01.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别东拉西扯的说那么多直接下命令就好
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.51,0:58:02.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就像平时一样
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.47,0:58:07.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,恕属下直言最近殿下对公子稍微有点太...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.99,0:58:09.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别说了 哈森
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.94,0:58:12.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,阿德尼斯也不能一直当个小孩
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.47,0:58:16.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,靠着半吊子的觉悟来继承家业的话可不行
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.24,0:58:17.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.10,0:58:18.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,够了 退下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.24,0:58:42.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不但失败了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.55,0:58:46.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还把他捧成了保护公主安全的英雄这结果真是...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.24,0:58:53.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,风吗
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.31,0:58:56.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂 哈森
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.15,0:59:03.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,刺客吗
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.40,0:59:31.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我...我认识你
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.11,0:59:36.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你是...格里菲斯的...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.58,1:01:23.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不 确实有声音
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.83,1:01:24.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有人
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.15,1:01:26.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有刺客
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.62,1:01:28.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂 那个是...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.02,1:01:29.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,阿德尼斯大人
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.48,1:01:31.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,混账
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.03,1:01:33.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有刺客
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.20,1:01:38.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,畜生 畜生
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.96,1:01:40.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,应该还在附近
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.72,1:01:41.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别大意
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.15,1:01:51.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,连阿德尼斯大人都...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.32,1:01:54.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,何等的...何等的残忍啊
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.52,1:02:05.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,给我找 别让刺客活着逃出这个屋子
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.70,1:02:17.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂 找到了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.90,1:02:20.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在西城墙上 夹击他
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.08,1:02:35.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,射
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.17,1:03:01.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,啊 现在这时候格里菲斯 正在公主殿下的晚餐吃着更好的东西吧
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.07,1:03:04.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,话虽如此
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.39,1:03:08.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但面对那些不熟悉的人也只会感到拘束吧 肯定
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.69,1:03:11.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那又怎样啊
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.48,1:03:13.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只要能吃好吃的吃到饱
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.38,1:03:16.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,再能跟香喷喷的贵族女人来一炮的话
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.18,1:03:17.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也是可以忍受的嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.32,1:03:19.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么来一炮啊
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.32,1:03:22.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那可是夏洛特殿下举办的晚餐会哦
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.17,1:03:24.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这也说得太难听...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.98,1:03:26.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,说起来 格斯人呢
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.01,1:03:28.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,今天从早上就不见他人呢
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.31,1:03:32.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,切 肯定又一个人练功发自真心去了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.04,1:03:33.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那个尽知道砍人的白痴
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.02,1:03:35.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,满上 皮聘
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.26,1:03:39.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,今天那家伙和我的队伍本来是预定进行联合训练的
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.70,1:03:42.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,竟然连声招呼都不打...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.70,1:03:50.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那个家伙
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.41,1:03:56.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,格斯
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.80,1:03:59.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,今天一天你都上哪闲晃去了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.87,1:04:05.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,格里菲斯呢
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.26,1:04:11.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,格里菲斯被请去参加夏洛特大人举办的晚餐会了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.38,1:04:14.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,应该是去了月见草会馆
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.61,1:04:19.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是吗
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.77,1:04:23.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂 话还没说完呢 格斯
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.63,1:04:29.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,箭伤?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.25,1:05:05.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好舒服的风
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.39,1:05:10.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我怎么也习惯不了那种气氛
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.02,1:05:14.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,稍微有点累了呢
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.41,1:05:27.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,请吧 夏洛特大人
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.49,1:05:33.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.12,1:05:44.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,站住
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.61,1:05:47.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你打算就现在这副样子走过去吗
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.05,1:05:49.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别给格里菲斯丢脸
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.23,1:05:52.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有事找他的话等他俩说完话后再说
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.05,1:05:54.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,借用一下哦
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.30,1:06:15.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为什么男人总是喜欢流血的事情呢...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.76,1:06:18.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,公主殿下说过这样的话吧
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.57,1:06:20.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.68,1:06:25.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,男人也许确实有这样野蛮的一面
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.50,1:06:30.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但那是为了赢得对自己来说重要的东西并且能守护他
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.08,1:06:33.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我认为这是一柄双刃剑
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.45,1:06:38.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,重要的东西...恋人吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.25,1:06:41.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,啊 不 是骑士的名誉?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.00,1:06:44.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这些都是很重要的东西呢
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.43,1:06:49.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为了爱和名誉战至死亡是骑士的夙愿
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.21,1:06:54.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是对男人来说
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.05,1:06:59.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在这之前恐怕已经遇到了另一件重要的东西
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.63,1:07:01.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,另一件?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.12,1:07:10.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是不为任何人只为了自己而成就的梦想
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.63,1:07:15.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,梦想...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.17,1:07:19.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,与身份啊 阶级啊 出身啊这些无关
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.45,1:07:22.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,人们会为了梦想而舍身追逐辗转反侧
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.07,1:07:24.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,被梦想所支撑
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.66,1:07:25.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因梦想而痛苦
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.20,1:07:27.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为梦想而活着
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.99,1:07:29.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,然后 被梦想杀死
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.99,1:07:36.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,即使在被梦想抛弃后也会在心里继续焖烧
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.03,1:07:39.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果是男人的话
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.16,1:07:41.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,总会想要去描绘出这样的人生
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.63,1:07:46.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,名为"梦想"的神的殉教者的人生
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.24,1:07:51.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因为被生下来了就仅仅这么活着
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.02,1:07:55.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这种活法 我可受不了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.48,1:08:07.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对不起对女性来说这是很无聊的话题呢
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.12,1:08:11.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嗯 不会啊...那个...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.14,1:08:16.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,格里菲斯大人你真是个不可思议的人呢
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.50,1:08:19.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,比任何贵族都更有贵族气质
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.66,1:08:26.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是 教会了我吹草笛的你又像是习惯野外玩耍的小孩子
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.63,1:08:30.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,然后现在呢 又像个哲学家
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.54,1:08:45.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你的诸位朋友们也是被这种魅力所吸引
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.71,1:08:47.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,才跟着你一路走来的吧
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.69,1:08:53.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们是好几次跟我一起越过死亡线的重要伙伴
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.42,1:08:58.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是 却不能说是朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.21,1:09:02.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果有一个绝不依附于别人的梦想
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.99,1:09:05.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,自己生存的理由由自己决定并去实践自己梦想
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.44,1:09:07.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,若有人蹂躏这个梦想
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.71,1:09:09.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,必定全心全力地与之对抗
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.08,1:09:13.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,即便是我也一定会的...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.53,1:09:16.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我觉得对我来说朋友就是
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.21,1:09:20.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,像这种能与我 对等的人
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.21,1:09:43.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,格里菲斯大人您的梦想是...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.63,1:09:46.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,公主殿下
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.21,1:09:54.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么事
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.80,1:09:56.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不不不 不得了了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.80,1:10:00.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,您叔叔他...尤里乌斯殿下逝世了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.10,1:10:01.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.50,1:10:05.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是暗杀 有人潜入了宅邸
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.07,1:10:07.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,连他的公子阿德尼斯大人都被...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.22,1:10:10.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,城里乱得不得了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.25,1:10:15.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,国王陛下命令中止晚餐会 马上回城
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.00,1:10:17.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,马上兵队就要到了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.44,1:10:19.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,得早做准备啊
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.09,1:10:22.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,回去了 格斯
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.76,1:10:24.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果是裘达干的那就要开战...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.17,1:10:25.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,格斯?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.95,1:11:11.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没有闲暇去思考多余的事
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.14,1:11:15.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现下要怎样去砍 怎样去杀
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.12,1:11:17.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,仅此而已
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.53,1:11:24.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我是那么的想成为那个人的剑...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.98,1:11:30.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么嘛 只是城寨稍微大了点而已嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.77,1:11:31.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,跟平常一样
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.15,1:11:34.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只要按格里菲斯说的去做就能赢
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.94,1:11:47.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,放弃生命
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.51,1:11:50.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,除此以外没别的方法可以让你存活
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.50,1:11:54.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只要活下来就是我们的胜利
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.42,1:11:59.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想一直看着
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.66,1:12:01.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,格里菲斯的鹰之团一直以来做了什么
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.30,1:12:04.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那家伙得到了什么
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.50,1:12:07.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,以及今后还想要得到什么
